 services, private wealth management, asset management, investment advisory, and research-backed investment solutions. Additionally, it offers knowledge services for debt basics, Indian debt market, market practices, monetary policy terminologies, and budget announcements and foreign portfolio investments. A. K. Capital Services Limited was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","employees":86,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1794960000,"asOf":1795774429},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795774429,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"A. K. Capital Services\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"A. K. Capital Services Completes ₹5 Crore Commercial Paper Allotment","s":"scanx.trade","d":1795639238,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"AK Capital Services Ltd 52 Week High Streak: Key Takeaways","s":"Univest","d":1795080360,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQNEROc1ZwTVNUTmNhVm1BSWJXcE1TeC1xb3ZkeEU3bndGUDk0QXlITzZpdXRkajdTX0VPSG1LWUxLQ2RJM0JmYURrWjRFRzU3bTZrYWVsMzhnbHRET3o2LWRRSl9NWmNwQllLbTdEbDhON3JNLU0ydzFGLUJzY2FrbXBpc0tkVkFvSE1jZkxqR0syVm95c2I1UA?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"A. K. Capital Services Insider Buyers See Boost After Market Cap Rose ₹1.5b","s":"Simply Wall St","d":1794962311,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"AK Capital Services allots ₹5 crore CPs at 8.90% discount rate","s":"scanx.trade","d":1792998000,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNR291czZmSFlPcDJVaHI5M2c5ZmgteG1Yand4TkRhRUZWMWh4bzlxcWhRaGZHZVdDU0xfNnE0eUxLN1JuRFVHdHJwTEpEVTVqSTBqWGRwVG1nejB0bUxfYjVtZTFYbnJRLVFQVlhQNW94RDFoVWR0YnVEVThQcTdJRGlPSWx5UEVvODhuWHFxQnJOdUFFel9McWUtTmFqcGxfM2gxUmt6ZTJjek1FUDluQnRtOGtzVzd4N2FF?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"AK Capital Services completes ₹12 interim dividend payout for FY26","s":"scanx.trade","d":1792738800,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQbllkZFRmSGpLalR3NllXX1k2UERTZUdBY1BObTZxZEtwNWxWVU91TmllUy1DcHlYc